{"id":"d726ed8c8ff79e38","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-flat.md","title":"Flat Module","display":"df-flat — Flat Module","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-flat","aliases":["58-df-flat","Flat Module"],"display":"df-flat — Flat Module","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-module.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-flat"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-flat</span><span>Flat Module</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-flat — Flat Module"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ef3a5dd6825f0373\" href=\"?note=ef3a5dd6825f0373\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-module.md\">../batch13/58-df-module.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,+_M,0_M,\\odot\\in V\">\\(R,M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,+_M,0_M,\\odot\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Module}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Module}_S\\)</span> is the explicit left-module predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ef3a5dd6825f0373\" href=\"?note=ef3a5dd6825f0373\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-module.md\">../batch13/58-df-module.md</a>.</li>\n<li>Finite sums carrying superscripts <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+_M\">\\(+_M\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+_R\">\\(+_R\\)</span> are the recursively defined sums for those displayed binary operations.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FlatModuleStructure}_S:V^9\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FlatModuleStructure}_S:V^9\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FlatModule}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FlatModule}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}flat\\text{-}structured}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FlatModuleStructure}_S\n(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Module}_S(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall r\\in R^n\\;\\forall m\\in M^n\\;\n\\Biggl(\n\\sum_{i&lt;n}^{+_M}\\odot(\\langle r(i),m(i)\\rangle)=0_M\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\to\\exists q\\in\\omega\\;\\exists A\\in(R^q)^n\\;\\exists y\\in M^q\\;\n\\Bigl[\n\\forall i&lt;n\\;\\Bigl(\nm(i)=\\sum_{j&lt;q}^{+_M}\\odot(\\langle A(i)(j),y(j)\\rangle)\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{17em}{}\\land\n\\forall j&lt;q\\;\\Bigl(\n\\sum_{i&lt;n}^{+_R}\\cdot_R(\\langle r(i),A(i)(j)\\rangle)=0_R\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr]\\Biggr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}flat\\text{-}structured}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FlatModuleStructure}_S\n(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Module}_S(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall r\\in R^n\\;\\forall m\\in M^n\\;\n\\Biggl(\n\\sum_{i&lt;n}^{+_M}\\odot(\\langle r(i),m(i)\\rangle)=0_M\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\to\\exists q\\in\\omega\\;\\exists A\\in(R^q)^n\\;\\exists y\\in M^q\\;\n\\Bigl[\n\\forall i&lt;n\\;\\Bigl(\nm(i)=\\sum_{j&lt;q}^{+_M}\\odot(\\langle A(i)(j),y(j)\\rangle)\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{17em}{}\\land\n\\forall j&lt;q\\;\\Bigl(\n\\sum_{i&lt;n}^{+_R}\\cdot_R(\\langle r(i),A(i)(j)\\rangle)=0_R\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr]\\Biggr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}flat\\text{-}carrier}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FlatModule}_S(M,R)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists +_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{FlatModuleStructure}_S\n(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}flat\\text{-}carrier}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FlatModule}_S(M,R)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists +_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{FlatModuleStructure}_S\n(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The structured clause is the finite-equation criterion for flatness. It is equivalent to preservation of monomorphisms by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"-\\otimes_RM\">\\(-\\otimes_RM\\)</span> but does not require an unformalized tensor-product constructor.</li>\n<li>The carrier-level predicate remains available for compatibility and existentially binds every ring and module operation.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Lam, Lectures on Modules and Rings</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-module.md","status":"resolved","id":"ef3a5dd6825f0373","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-module.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-module.md","status":"resolved","id":"ef3a5dd6825f0373","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Module}_S$ is the explicit left-module predicate from [[../batch13/58-df-module.md]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"R,M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,+_M,0_M,\\odot\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Module}_S","display":false},{"tex":"+_M","display":false},{"tex":"+_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FlatModuleStructure}_S:V^9\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FlatModule}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}flat\\text{-}structured}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{FlatModuleStructure}_S\n(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Module}_S(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall r\\in R^n\\;\\forall m\\in M^n\\;\n\\Biggl(\n\\sum_{i<n}^{+_M}\\odot(\\langle r(i),m(i)\\rangle)=0_M\\\\\n&\\qquad{}\\to\\exists q\\in\\omega\\;\\exists A\\in(R^q)^n\\;\\exists y\\in M^q\\;\n\\Bigl[\n\\forall i<n\\;\\Bigl(\nm(i)=\\sum_{j<q}^{+_M}\\odot(\\langle A(i)(j),y(j)\\rangle)\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\hspace{17em}{}\\land\n\\forall j<q\\;\\Bigl(\n\\sum_{i<n}^{+_R}\\cdot_R(\\langle r(i),A(i)(j)\\rangle)=0_R\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr]\\Biggr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}flat\\text{-}carrier}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FlatModule}_S(M,R)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists +_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{FlatModuleStructure}_S\n(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"-\\otimes_RM","display":false}],"bytes":1927,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-537","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-flat.md|58-df-flat]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["ef3a5dd6825f0373"]}